lue":"From Account, you can export your ledger, sign out, or request account deletion. Accounts containing only points data can be deleted immediately. Shared learning services, scanned files, or older records may require coordinated cleanup. You will receive a receipt and status updates, usually within 30 days."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可在账户导出账本、退出登录或申请注销。仅有积分数据的账号可直接删除；涉及共享学习服务、扫描档案或旧资料的账号需协调清理，显示真实回执及处理状态，通常30天内处理。"}}}},"Golden Splendor":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Golden Splendor"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"金碧辉煌"}}}},"Got it":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Got it"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"知道啦"}}}},"Growth":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Growth"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成长"}}}},"Growth Treasury Privacy Policy":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Growth Treasury Privacy Policy"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成长小金库隐私政策"}}}},"Growth Treasury Terms of Use":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Growth Treasury Terms of Use"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成长小金库用户协议"}}}},"Growth Treasury lets parents manage family points, record progress, and redeem rewards agreed on within the family. Points cannot be purchased, cashed out, or used to buy goods supplied by the developer.":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Growth Treasury lets parents manage family points, record progress, and redeem rewards agreed on within the family. Points cannot be purchased, cashed out, or used to buy goods supplied by the developer."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成长小金库由家长管理家庭积分，用于记录表现和兑换家庭自行约定的奖励。积分没有充值、提现或由开发者履约的商品交易功能。"}}}},"Help":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Help"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"帮助"}}}},"Hide Password":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hide Password"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隐藏密码"}}}},"Highest":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Highest"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最高"}}}},"Home Name":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Home Name"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"房名"}}}},"Humble Beginnings":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Humble Beginnings"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"贫民窟"}}}},"I have read and agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I have read and agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"我已阅读并同意用户协议与隐私政策"}}}},"Icon":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Icon"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"图标"}}}},"If this email is linked and verified, you’ll receive a recovery email. Please check your spam folder.":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"If this email is linked and verified, you’ll receive a recovery email. Please check your spam folder."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"若该邮箱已绑定验证，将收到找回邮件。请检查垃圾邮件。"}}}},"If you already have an account, sign in before linking your phone number to keep your ledger. New accounts start with 0 points. You can add a nickname, password, and email later.":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"If you already have an account, sign in before linking your phone number to keep your ledger. New accounts start with 0 points. You can add a nickname, password, and email later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已有旧